  {
   "id": 632299,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The linear function <span data-math=\"f(x)=x\">f(x)=x</span> has a vertical compression of <span data-math=\"\\frac13\">\\frac13</span> and a vertical shift up 2. Which of the following is the new function?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224395,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=2x-\\frac13\">f(x)=2x-\\frac13</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1224394,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=2x+\\frac13\">f(x)=2x+\\frac13</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1224393,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=-\\frac13x+2\">f(x)=-\\frac13x+2</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1224396,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=\\frac13x+2\">f(x)=\\frac13x+2</span>"
    }
   ],
